# 🚀 Terraform AWS DevOps Project

## 📌 Overview

This project provisions a **production-ready AWS infrastructure** using Terraform with a modular architecture.

It includes VPC, public & private subnets, NAT Gateway, EC2 instances, and environment-based deployment (dev & prod).

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* Terraform
* AWS (EC2, VPC, Subnet, NAT Gateway, Internet Gateway)
* Infrastructure as Code (IaC)

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

Public Subnet:

* EC2 (Web Server - Nginx)
* NAT Gateway

Private Subnet:

* EC2 (App Server - Secure)

Networking:

* VPC
* Internet Gateway
* Route Tables

---

