## ⚙️ Features

* Modular Terraform design
* Environment separation (dev & prod)
* Secure architecture (private subnet)
* NAT Gateway for outbound internet access
* Automated EC2 provisioning (Nginx setup)

---

## ▶️ How to Run

### For Dev Environment

cd env/dev
terraform init
terraform apply

### For Prod Environment

cd env/prod
terraform init
terraform apply

